      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 5.19,
          "en": "Now whilst it's nice that we have this overlay here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.19,
          "end": 8.46,
          "en": "it's not that nice that we can't get rid of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.46,
          "end": 10.02,
          "en": "I can type something here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.02,
          "end": 12.92,
          "en": "and you see that it gets updated in the background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.92,
          "end": 15.12,
          "en": "But of course it would be great",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.12,
          "end": 17.25,
          "en": "if we could close this modal somehow.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.25,
          "end": 19.59,
          "en": "For example, by clicking on that backdrop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.59,
          "end": 22.173,
          "en": "on that transparent black background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.04,
          "end": 25.983,
          "en": "So how could we achieve this behavior?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.03,
          "end": 30.36,
          "en": "Well, in the end, again, with help of state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.36,
          "end": 32.31,
          "en": "You could say one state should be that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.31,
          "end": 34.594,
          "en": "the modal is visible, and the never state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.594,
          "end": 38.04,
          "en": "should be that it's not visible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.04,
          "end": 40.68,
          "en": "And then for example, by clicking on that background",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.68,
          "end": 42.36,
          "en": "we wanna update the state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.36,
          "end": 47.16,
          "en": "and switch it from is visible to is not visible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.16,
          "end": 49.559,
          "en": "And then we wanna display this entire modal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.559,
          "end": 53.553,
          "en": "conditionally based on that state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.54,
          "end": 57.06,
          "en": "So it's in the end a three step process:",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.06,
          "end": 59.07,
          "en": "register and use state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.07,
          "end": 61.11,
          "en": "add an event listener to this backdrop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.11,
          "end": 65.493,
          "en": "and then use that state to show, or not show, this modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.93,
          "end": 71.58,
          "en": "So to implement this, I'm back here in posts list JSX",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.58,
          "end": 74.01,
          "en": "and I'll zoom out a bit since the code keeps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.01,
          "end": 75,
          "en": "on growing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75,
          "end": 78.18,
          "en": "And there we now don't just wanna manage these two",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.18,
          "end": 81.21000000000001,
          "en": "values that can be submitted or entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.21000000000001,
          "end": 83.97,
          "en": "through that form, but I instead now also want to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 83.97,
          "end": 87.87,
          "en": "add an additional state slice here with useState.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.87,
          "end": 89.912,
          "en": "And the position does not matter if it's the first",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.912,
          "end": 93.63300000000001,
          "en": "the second, or the last state, this does not matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.83,
          "end": 99.03,
          "en": "But here the default value should for example, be true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.03,
          "end": 103.02000000000001,
          "en": "because here I won't manage some text as a state value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.02000000000001,
          "end": 107.58,
          "en": "but instead the modal is visible state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.58,
          "end": 109.56,
          "en": "The name is up to you, but you should try",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.56,
          "end": 112.97999999999999,
          "en": "to describe what's controlled by that state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.97999999999999,
          "end": 115.773,
          "en": "And here I want to control the modal visibility.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 116.85,
          "end": 119.043,
          "en": "So I'll name it, modal is visible and the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.043,
          "end": 122.04,
          "en": "updating function could be called \"set modal\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.04,
          "end": 124.41,
          "en": "is visible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.41,
          "end": 126.24,
          "en": "And by default here it's true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.24,
          "end": 129.183,
          "en": "So that we start with the mod being visible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.53,
          "end": 132.9,
          "en": "Of course this alone doesn't do much.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 132.9,
          "end": 136.013,
          "en": "We now also need to add some code to change this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.013,
          "end": 139.14,
          "en": "if we click on this background here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 139.14,
          "end": 141.09,
          "en": "Now to achieve this, we can go to the modal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.09,
          "end": 144.03,
          "en": "component because here we got that background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 144.03,
          "end": 145.473,
          "en": "It's this div here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 146.31,
          "end": 150.93,
          "en": "And there we can add the on click event listener.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.93,
          "end": 152.79,
          "en": "Click is another default event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 152.79,
          "end": 155.64,
          "en": "And on click is there for a prop we can add to set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 155.64,
          "end": 159.57,
          "en": "up a listener to the click event on that div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 159.57,
          "end": 162.78,
          "en": "And the function that should be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 162.78,
          "end": 165.6,
          "en": "should now not be defined here in this modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.6,
          "end": 167.22,
          "en": "But again, in posts list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 167.22,
          "end": 170.103,
          "en": "So again, we're lifting the state up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 171.03,
          "end": 173.52,
          "en": "Here we can add a new function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 173.52,
          "end": 177.18,
          "en": "Show model handler for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 177.18,
          "end": 181.23,
          "en": "Or in our case actually the hide modal handler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 181.23,
          "end": 182.58,
          "en": "because that's what we want to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 182.58,
          "end": 184.143,
          "en": "if the backdrop is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 185.07,
          "end": 187.89,
          "en": "And here we can call set modal is visible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 187.89,
          "end": 190.833,
          "en": "and set it to false as a new state value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 192.51,
          "end": 195.51,
          "en": "Now we have to pass this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 195.51,
          "end": 199.92000000000002,
          "en": "as a value to the modal component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 199.92000000000002,
          "end": 202.92000000000002,
          "en": "So here we could add a prop called on close.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 202.92000000000002,
          "end": 204.03,
          "en": "It's your component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.03,
          "end": 206.4,
          "en": "So to prop them is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 206.4,
          "end": 209.025,
          "en": "And pass the hide modal handler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 209.025,
          "end": 212.109,
          "en": "as a value to on close, again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 212.109,
          "end": 215.34,
          "en": "without parenthesis, passing the function itself",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215.34,
          "end": 219.6,
          "en": "as a value rather than the return value of that function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 219.6,
          "end": 220.98,
          "en": "Which is what we would pass",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 220.98,
          "end": 223.68,
          "en": "if we would have parentheses here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 223.68,
          "end": 225.573,
          "en": "So we passed the function itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 226.74,
          "end": 229.59199999999998,
          "en": "And since I named the prop on close here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 229.59199999999998,
          "end": 233.52,
          "en": "in the model component, we can now also restructure this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 233.52,
          "end": 236.7,
          "en": "on close prop here, and set it as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 236.7,
          "end": 238.56,
          "en": "to on click.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 238.56,
          "end": 240.84,
          "en": "So that this function, which we receive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 240.84,
          "end": 243.395,
          "en": "on the on close prop is set as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 243.395,
          "end": 245.64,
          "en": "for the on click prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 245.64,
          "end": 247.715,
          "en": "Hence wiring this click listener up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 247.715,
          "end": 252.033,
          "en": "to this height modal handler function in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 253.38,
          "end": 255.9,
          "en": "Now with that, we have a way of updating the state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 255.9,
          "end": 259.116,
          "en": "but right now we still wouldn't see any effect on the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 259.116,
          "end": 261.046,
          "en": "because we're not doing anything with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 261.046,
          "end": 263.34,
          "en": "that modal is visible state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 263.34,
          "end": 266.64,
          "en": "We're updating it, but we're not using it thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 266.64,
          "end": 268.14,
          "en": "And that's the last step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 268.14,
          "end": 271.53,
          "en": "Now we wanna render this modal conditionally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 271.53,
          "end": 273.033,
          "en": "Based on our state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 274.02,
          "end": 277.26,
          "en": "So the goal is to only render this piece of code here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 277.26,
          "end": 281.25,
          "en": "This JSX code, if modal is visible is true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 281.25,
          "end": 282.723,
          "en": "Now how can we achieve this?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 283.92,
          "end": 285.334,
          "en": "Again, with a dynamic value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 285.334,
          "end": 288.06,
          "en": "so with single curly braces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 288.06,
          "end": 291.139,
          "en": "But now we don't just wanna output modal is visible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 291.139,
          "end": 293.763,
          "en": "We don't just wanna output true or false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 293.763,
          "end": 295.44,
          "en": "but instead we wanna control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 295.44,
          "end": 297.93,
          "en": "what's being shown on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 297.93,
          "end": 300.407,
          "en": "We could achieve this with a ternary expression.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 300.407,
          "end": 304.08,
          "en": "If that's true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 304.08,
          "end": 306.701,
          "en": "And for that, we can also just check mod is visible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 306.701,
          "end": 308.653,
          "en": "We want to output this content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 308.653,
          "end": 312.87,
          "en": "And indeed you can cut and paste that content here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 312.87,
          "end": 314.31,
          "en": "after the question mark.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 314.31,
          "end": 315.8,
          "en": "And then add a colon here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 315.8,
          "end": 317.955,
          "en": "since I'm writing a ternary expression",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 317.955,
          "end": 320.97,
          "en": "where we also define what should be rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 320.97,
          "end": 322.233,
          "en": "if this is false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 323.28,
          "end": 324.87,
          "en": "And that could be null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 324.87,
          "end": 328.237,
          "en": "Null is something you can output as part of your JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 328.237,
          "end": 332.523,
          "en": "and it will simply lead to nothing being rendered here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 334.8,
          "end": 336.96,
          "en": "Alternatively, you could also set this to false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 336.96,
          "end": 339.003,
          "en": "and this would also render nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 340.17,
          "end": 342.499,
          "en": "If I now save this, you see, by default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 342.499,
          "end": 345.165,
          "en": "this is open, which should make sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 345.165,
          "end": 347.671,
          "en": "because our default state value is true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 347.671,
          "end": 350.073,
          "en": "for modal is visible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 351.39,
          "end": 355.95,
          "en": "But if I click on this backdrop, it disappears",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 355.95,
          "end": 359.149,
          "en": "And it disappears because I set the state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 359.149,
          "end": 360.84,
          "en": "to false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 360.84,
          "end": 362.55,
          "en": "That's what we do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 362.55,
          "end": 365.04,
          "en": "And thanks to this ternary expression,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 365.04,
          "end": 367.95,
          "en": "it's then this L's that becomes active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 367.95,
          "end": 370.47,
          "en": "And if you output false, or null here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 370.47,
          "end": 372.33,
          "en": "nothing gets displayed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 372.33,
          "end": 376.59,
          "en": "on the screen in this place in your JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 376.59,
          "end": 378.445,
          "en": "The other parts, like this list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 378.445,
          "end": 381.63,
          "en": "are still being output, but this content to be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 381.63,
          "end": 383.905,
          "en": "precise, is now rendered conditionally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 383.905,
          "end": 386.883,
          "en": "With help of the ternary expression.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 388.38,
          "end": 390.81,
          "en": "Now there are other approaches, as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 390.81,
          "end": 392.58,
          "en": "We could, for example, add a variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 392.58,
          "end": 395.096,
          "en": "modal content and by default set that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 395.096,
          "end": 399.06,
          "en": "to nothing, so to undefined.",
