        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 399.06,
          "end": 403.32,
          "en": "And then check if modal is visible is true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 403.32,
          "end": 405.837,
          "en": "And in that case, set modal content to",
