        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 463.714,
          "end": 466.29,
          "en": "being reflected on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 466.29,
          "end": 468.216,
          "en": "So with that code, if I reload the page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 468.216,
          "end": 469.592,
          "en": "it will still close",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 469.592,
          "end": 471.513,
          "en": "if I click on the backdrop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 472.83,
          "end": 475.35,
          "en": "And one last alternative, which I want to show you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 475.35,
          "end": 477.42,
          "en": "though this here is a great approach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 477.42,
          "end": 479.928,
          "en": "since it's also quite readable, is that",
