          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 510.72,
          "end": 513.4639999999999,
          "en": "Or to be precise, it will output the falsey value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 513.4639999999999,
          "end": 515.19,
          "en": "false in this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 515.19,
          "end": 516.42,
          "en": "And that, as you learned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 516.42,
          "end": 519.96,
          "en": "will lead to nothing showing up on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 519.96,
          "end": 523.11,
          "en": "So here we're using standard JavaScript to render nothing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 523.11,
          "end": 524.34,
          "en": "or the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 524.34,
          "end": 526.744,
          "en": "So that's another approach of making sure",
